{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"dominating-effete-bat","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"## Observation\n\n`make verify` (integration tier) fails on a host that has a `git-remote-s3` binary on PATH from a separate install, when the worktree venv was provisioned by `make install` / `make worktree`:\n\n```\ntests/integration/test_s3_doctor.py::test_git_remote_s3_api_surface_contract\nE   ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'git_remote_s3'\n```\n\nMeasured 2026-11-02 PST in a fresh `make worktree` checkout at `66bfebcf7f2` (plus an unrelated sync change): `which -a git-remote-s3` → `~/.local/bin/git-remote-s3`; the worktree `.venv/bin/python -c \"import git_remote_s3\"` → ModuleNotFoundError. 20,360 default-tier tests passed; this was the only failure in the 206-test integration tier.\n\n## Cause (from the source)\n\nThe test's `skipif` checks `shutil.which(\"git-remote-s3\")` (a binary anywhere on PATH), but the body imports the Python package from the running interpreter. `make install` syncs `--extra dev --extra metrics` plus `TEST_EXTRAS := reviewbot ui grounding-terraform`, which does not include `s3`. So the guard and the body test different things: any host with the helper installed outside the venv runs the test without the package and fails.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The skip condition checks the thing the test uses (the `git_remote_s3` package importable in the running interpreter, e.g. `pytest.importorskip`), or the test-extras set includes `s3` and the CI parity test is updated to match; the choice is recorded here.\n- [ ] `make verify` passes this test (or skips it) on a host with `git-remote-s3` on PATH and no `[s3]` extra in the venv.\n","id":"a54e-4b02-ab42-481f","parent_id":"","priority":3,"tags":["tests","make-verify","s3"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"test_git_remote_s3_api_surface_contract skips on a PATH binary but imports the venv package; make verify fails on hosts with git-remote-s3 installed outside the venv"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1793678011180195850,"uuid":"f1501070-3d92-4fde-a665-2dd8d720b0e5"}